@startuml
title Two Frontends, One Specification Seam
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam ArrowColor #334155

package "Frontends (authoring)" #F8FAFC {
  rectangle "**`language!` macro**\nRust token stream\n<latex>\texttt{parse\_macro\_input!}</latex>\nast/src/language/parse.rs" as Macro #FEF3C7
  rectangle "**Rholang spec value** [Proposed]\nnested List / Map / String\nelaborated by <latex>\mathcal{E}</latex>\n(this FIPS)" as RhoSpec #E0E7FF
}

rectangle "**`LanguageDef`**\nthe sole backend input\nast/src/language/model.rs" as LD #DBEAFE

package "Backends (generation)" #F8FAFC {
  rectangle "PraTTaIL / WPDA\nparser codegen\n<latex>\rightarrow</latex> Rust source" as Pratt #DCFCE7
  rectangle "rho-native lowering\n<latex>\rightarrow \texttt{rhoapi::Par}</latex>" as RhoGen #DCFCE7
  rectangle "Dovetail + set automaton\n<latex>\rightarrow</latex> rule DAG" as Dove #DCFCE7
  rectangle "test / simulator / Blockly\nemitters" as Emit #DCFCE7
}

rectangle "AST types, freshness fns,\nmetadata, `Language` impl\n<latex>\rightarrow</latex> Rust source" as Rust #DCFCE7

Macro --> LD : parses Rust tokens
RhoSpec --> LD : elaborates a value\n**fail-closed**
LD --> Pratt
LD --> RhoGen
LD --> Dove
LD --> Emit
LD --> Rust

note bottom of LD
  Every generator's signature is
  <latex>f(\&\,\texttt{LanguageDef}) \rightarrow \text{artifact}</latex>.
  The seam is already clean; this FIPS
  adds a second producer, not a new seam.
end note

legend right
  |= Color |= Role |
  |<#FEF3C7> | Existing Rust frontend (retained) |
  |<#E0E7FF> | Proposed Rholang frontend |
  |<#DBEAFE> | The shared specification datatype |
  |<#DCFCE7> | Backend generators (unchanged) |
endlegend
@enduml
